    "title": "XL-MS of Sec18 and SNAREs in S. cerevisiae",
    "additionalAttributes": [],
    "projectDescription": "To identify what SNAREs and what residues of the SNAREs are in contact with Sec18",
    "sampleProcessingProtocol": "Yeast cells were treated with zymolyase and incubated with DSG crosslinker for 30 minutes. Following this, coIP against Sec18, SDS-PAGE gel and gel excision was used prior to submission to mass-spec facilities",
